 problem and irritation for people ie our close ones!!", "timestamp": 1730464119, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ayesha.clinicalpsychologist", "author_id": "59904260410", "id": "18080313619550487", "text": "Absolutely true #emotionalvalidation #acceptanceofemotions", "timestamp": 1729855523, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "straightforwardpsychology", "author_id": "44202577892", "id": "18465541513012985", "text": "Amen sis ❤️", "timestamp": 1729683680, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "soumya.ys", "author_id": "34860941701", "id": "18043247048044774", "text": "❤️🙌", "timestamp": 1729233765, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "esse.ntial285", "author_id": "63015874058", "id": "18325637026159852", "text": "Period pain and pad irritation these are things which make me angry, 😢", "timestamp": 1729025708, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "reeborn.app", "author_id": "65892622703", "id": "18132616207330386", "text": "it’s resistance that causes emotions to be uncomfortable 🙏", "timestamp": 1728919304, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ananasbhl", "author_id": "47289041161", "id": "18046732148057520", "text": "Pov : the opposite of resistance is not acceptance... it is giving up .. peace", "timestamp": 1728862205, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mellismindset", "author_id": "64745847854", "id": "17965557083674340", "text": "absolutely ❤️❤️❤️", "timestamp": 1728491003, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "healingwithpranati", "author_id": "27770399750", "id": "18039443350922213", "text": "So true 🙌", "timestamp": 1728362617, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "abishekjavier", "author_id": "58479289841", "id": "18042301306892986", "text": "Why u so wise ...", "timestamp": 1728061750, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/C6qyl3FOjW3/", "webpage_url_basename": "C6qyl3FOjW3", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/504379241_1339935277092792_6737096202919061758_n.jpg